   "n_markup": 27,
   "text": "    <sec id=\"s2\">\n      <title>Method</title>\n      <p>Each node of the parsed document gets its own sequence identifier, and every token is tagged with the identifiers of its node and all descendants. Siblings therefore cannot attend to each other.</p>\n      <p>To evict a subtree we remove its identifiers over its position range; the freed cells are reused by later tokens.</p>\n"
  },
