   "text": "    <sec id=\"s3\">\n      <title>Experiments</title>\n      <p>We evaluated the method on 120 documents from four domains using a 1-billion-parameter model on a laptop CPU.</p>\n      <p>Evicting unused subtrees reduced cache memory by 38 percent on average while answer accuracy stayed within one point of the full prompt.</p>\n"
